    "show_share": true,
    "description": "WhenLilliane Angella Namala, a passionate classroom teacher with five years of experience in Uganda, enrolled in theMaster of Education (M.Ed.)in Leadership and Managementpart-time programme at theAga Khan University, Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED, EA)in 2021, she was seeking answers. Whyeducational systemsfacing declining performance? Was the solution rooted in leadership, management, or policy?",
